        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "69e15b55-d203-3fc5-93c1-d639c686c9c6",
                "word": "globalement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fcd25ef-9728-3638-9aad-9476068c5b4e",
                        "entry_id": "69e15b55-d203-3fc5-93c1-d639c686c9c6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une façon globale, générale, en bloc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8862b0c4-da20-4296-957d-be2c5c19a0cd",
                                "sense_id": "8fcd25ef-9728-3638-9aad-9476068c5b4e",
                                "text": "Vous savez que l’Union du crédit [établissement financier, en Belgique] n’avait point de capital nominal ; c’était une mutualité où quatre mille associés solidaires les uns des autres, et tous ensemble responsables à l’égard des autres, représentaient globalement une surface de soixante millions."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "acd864e0-4009-3551-8221-3697353338e5",
                        "entry_id": "69e15b55-d203-3fc5-93c1-d639c686c9c6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "À l’échelle du globe, du monde."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8ffc8a6-e673-40ec-9b3b-bc0a356dd65b",
                                "sense_id": "acd864e0-4009-3551-8221-3697353338e5",
                                "text": "La production industrielle est désormais pensée globalement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6bc54ec1-e74d-4baa-b117-1f4ea0c05eec",
                        "source_entry_id": "69e15b55-d203-3fc5-93c1-d639c686c9c6",
                        "source_sense_id": "8fcd25ef-9728-3638-9aad-9476068c5b4e",
                        "source_sense_description": "D’une façon globale, générale, en bloc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "roughly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roughly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f71c3c5-476c-3046-a762-140d6acfac7d",
                                        "entry_id": "33294cf3-e327-3188-ad64-042787b1c7fe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a rough manner; without kindness, softness, or gentleness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d2db1b8-e915-4f8a-be54-15f214ff51b9",
                                                "sense_id": "9f71c3c5-476c-3046-a762-140d6acfac7d",
                                                "text": "They treated the prisoners roughly [...] slashing pitilessly with their whips to drive them as wretched animals before them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bec66e0-f6aa-3a06-a6e4-b7b957dd422f",
                                        "entry_id": "33294cf3-e327-3188-ad64-042787b1c7fe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unevenly or irregularly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23fa476f-7c73-39f6-948e-a410002b604b",
                                        "entry_id": "33294cf3-e327-3188-ad64-042787b1c7fe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without precision or exactness; imprecisely but close to in quantity or amount; approximately."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "612262c7-61c2-40c8-9ec3-466be498042e",
                                                "sense_id": "23fa476f-7c73-39f6-948e-a410002b604b",
                                                "text": "Satanism can be divided, roughly, into two branches: the Luciferians and the Palladists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6af7cb51-cef4-4b15-9d92-7edaeebcffd6",
                                                "sense_id": "23fa476f-7c73-39f6-948e-a410002b604b",
                                                "text": "Of the roughly 400 emerging infectious diseases that have been identified since 1940, more than 60% are zoonotic: ie they came from animals. Throughout history this has been common."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e7db10f-3e05-49e0-b833-67c5bb886187",
                        "source_entry_id": "69e15b55-d203-3fc5-93c1-d639c686c9c6",
                        "source_sense_id": "8fcd25ef-9728-3638-9aad-9476068c5b4e",
                        "source_sense_description": "D’une façon globale, générale, en bloc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "globalmente",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "globalmente",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bcbac7b-1a15-3792-af77-b909839c60b5",
                                        "entry_id": "2e0a3fbd-4f46-34ed-a88d-ddbd9dc28b90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "De un modo colectivo, conjunto."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22b9f784-6673-4c14-a143-267ea7fbf485",
                                                "sense_id": "8bcbac7b-1a15-3792-af77-b909839c60b5",
                                                "text": "El primer planteamiento no es, desde luego, globalmente insano; pero el segundo implica un razonamiento que se sale del fin material, que supone un objetivo vital-espiritual, un campo de visión qeu atraviesa el plano mundano penetrando en otras dimensiones, puede que incluso, a fin de cuentas, más reales que la cruda y dura \"realidad\""
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30091ab1-4421-3672-ba5b-c2701dc3cc7d",
                                        "entry_id": "2e0a3fbd-4f46-34ed-a88d-ddbd9dc28b90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "De forma colectiva refiriéndose a la población del mundo, o al planeta Tierra."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8962d686-d10b-434f-861e-2c2232cbdd8f",
                                                "sense_id": "30091ab1-4421-3672-ba5b-c2701dc3cc7d",
                                                "text": "Sin perder de vista las exigencias y las obligaciones que supone la pertenencia a la especie y a sus problemas de conjunto, es necesario poder actuar en función y a la escala del hombre. René Dubos sintetiza: \"Piensa globalmente, pero actúa localmente\""
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
